#: ../../source/docs/roadmap.rst:12 16b9836bc1bc4d6aba3a4835094c7751
msgid ""
"This roadmap shows the direction of the ArduPilot team in 2020 and "
"beyond.  The purpose of this roadmap is not to guarantee exactly when "
"features will be added but instead to help the team, `Partners "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ and independent developers to "
"spot areas for cooperation.  There will also undoubtedly be developments "
"that are not on this list."
msgstr ""
"本路线图展示了 ArduPilot 团队在 2020 年及未来的发展方向。路线图的目的不是保证功能的具体上线时间，而是帮助团队、`合作伙伴 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ "
"和独立开发者发现合作领域。毫无疑问，也会有未列入本清单的开发项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/roadmap.rst:16 42c04568c49b462ab09b9c2bf80a026d
msgid ""
"The main point of contact for each area is provided so that those looking"
" to join in or sponsor the development know who to contact (see "
":ref:`Contact Us <common-contact-us>` for a list of ways to contact the "
"devs)."
msgstr ""
"每个领域的主要联系人已列出，方便希望参与或赞助开发的人员知道该联系谁（联系开发者的方式列表见 :ref:`联系我们 <common-"
"contact-us>`）。"

